flowchart TB
    accTitle: Reviewed sync and execution
    accDescr: For mesh and the reusable project template, review and merge precede sync. Sync can require its own manual release. Execution always has a separate manual release and verifies the staged snapshot.
    B["Branch and merge request"] --> V["Validate without deployment credentials"]
    V --> R["Maintainer reviews and merges"]
    R --> S["Sync exact commit<br/>Automatic or separately released"]
    S --> H["Review staged receipt<br/>Commit, inventory and destination"]
    H --> P["Manually release deployment"]
    P --> X["Verify snapshot and execute<br/>No second Git fetch"]
    X --> A["Inspect reports and target health"]
    classDef approval fill:#fff5df,stroke:#a77822,color:#533a0b
    classDef result fill:#edf8f2,stroke:#3d8164,color:#143b2b
    class R,P approval
    class H,A result
